WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.849 --> 00:00:06.180
Hollywood has lined up plenty of high-profile
horror projects in 2018, and no surprise,

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:09.870
most of the best ones are slated to hit theaters
right around Halloween.

00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:14.780
From jungle predators to freaky nuns, the
future looks very dark indeed, in the best

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:16.020
possible way.

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:20.370
Here are all the horror movies that'll blow
you away this Halloween season.

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:21.370
Slender Man

00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:25.530
Lovers of creepy internet memes have a pretty
good idea of what to expect with this upcoming

00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:26.530
horror film.

00:00:26.530 --> 00:00:30.990
The Slender Man has stalked the Web since
2009, when a Photoshop contest produced a

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:35.610
picture of the tall, thin, faceless stalker
of hapless children.

00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:40.100
The forum poster who made the image even has
a writing credit on the film, a development

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:44.690
he probably didn't expect when he set out
to freak people out with his Photoshop skills.

00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:50.139
"Then that's what I will say, unless Slender
Man commands me to say something else."

00:00:50.139 --> 00:00:55.409
The film's plot involves teen girls performing
rituals related to the Slender Man, and stars

00:00:55.409 --> 00:00:57.530
Joey King and Jaz Sinclair.

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:02.339
Sony and Screen Gems have slated Slender Man
for release on August 24th.

00:01:02.339 --> 00:01:04.019
Cadaver

00:01:04.019 --> 00:01:08.560
Audiences may know Shay Mitchell best from
her role on TV's Pretty Little Liars, but

00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:13.520
this Halloween season, the Canadian actress
is making the jump to horror with Cadaver.

00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:18.000
Mitchell stars as a morgue technician and
disgraced former cop with a drug problem,

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:22.450
whose late-night shifts at the morgue take
a turn for the sinister when she receives

00:01:22.450 --> 00:01:24.750
a badly brutalized body.

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:29.659
Veteran Dutch director Diederik Van Rooijen
makes his Hollywood debut with this feature.

00:01:29.659 --> 00:01:34.790
Although Cadaver has wrapped principal photography,
audiences will have to wait until August 24th

00:01:34.790 --> 00:01:36.290
to get a look.

00:01:36.290 --> 00:01:37.290
The Little Stranger

00:01:37.290 --> 00:01:42.649
Writer/director Lenny Abrahamson spent several
years quietly making a name for himself in

00:01:42.649 --> 00:01:48.979
his native Ireland before making a huge splash
with the 2015 international production Room.

00:01:48.979 --> 00:01:53.620
Despite receiving only a limited release in
the U.S., Room was nominated for a slew of

00:01:53.620 --> 00:01:57.869
awards and snagged a Best Actress Oscar for
lead Brie Larson.

00:01:57.869 --> 00:02:02.700
For his follow-up project, Abrahamson has
taken on an adaptation of the well-received

00:02:02.700 --> 00:02:08.210
2009 novel The Little Stranger by Sarah Waters,
a film which took about ten seconds to get

00:02:08.210 --> 00:02:12.590
snapped up by Focus Features for worldwide
distribution after going into production in

00:02:12.590 --> 00:02:13.790
summer 2017.

00:02:13.790 --> 00:02:19.610
The post-World War 2 ghost story boasts a
strong cast which includes Domnhall Gleason,

00:02:19.610 --> 00:02:22.100
Ruth Wilson, and Will Poulter.

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:24.640
The Little Stranger is slated for release
on August 31st.

00:02:24.640 --> 00:02:26.370
The Nun

00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:31.450
The series that New Line is now officially
calling the "Conjuring Universe" is getting

00:02:31.450 --> 00:02:33.450
another spinoff this Halloween season.

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:38.730
The franchise scored yet another box office
hit with Annabelle: Creation, a pre-prequel

00:02:38.730 --> 00:02:42.240
exploring the origins of the sinister doll
from The Conjuring 2, pushing the series'

00:02:42.240 --> 00:02:46.320
worldwide box office take up over the $1 billion
mark.

00:02:46.320 --> 00:02:50.930
Hitting those kinds of numbers can only ensure
plenty more films in the pipeline, and first

00:02:50.930 --> 00:02:56.620
up is The Nun, which will add some backstory
to one of Conjuring 2's most terrifying characters.

00:02:56.620 --> 00:03:01.670
American Horror Story's Taissa Farmiga, the
younger sister of main Conjuring series star

00:03:01.670 --> 00:03:07.730
Vera Farmiga, has been cast in the lead, with
Bonnie Aarons reprising her role as the demonic

00:03:07.730 --> 00:03:09.150
nun Valak.

00:03:09.150 --> 00:03:14.150
Creatively, the spinoff appears to be in good
hands, Annabelle and Annabelle: Creation screenwriter

00:03:14.150 --> 00:03:18.880
Gary Dauberman penned the script, and Corin
Hardy has been tapped to direct.

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:23.250
Hardy used practical effects whenever possible
on the shoot, portions of which took place

00:03:23.250 --> 00:03:25.760
on location in Romania and Transylvania.

00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:27.450
He told Entertainment Weekly:

00:03:27.450 --> 00:03:33.210
"I always want to say, 'Let's do everything
as much as we possibly can for real, including

00:03:33.210 --> 00:03:39.740
in-camera stunts, effects, and then use the
CGI to be a beautiful, original, invisible

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:40.740
tool.'"

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:46.200
The Nun will return to scare your pants off
on September 7th, 2018.

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:48.130
Slaughterhouse Rulez

00:03:48.130 --> 00:03:52.180
Horror comedy is notoriously difficult to
pull off, but if any filmmakers have earned

00:03:52.180 --> 00:03:55.390
the benefit of the doubt, it's Simon Pegg
and Nick Frost.

00:03:55.390 --> 00:04:01.250
Their 2005 classic Shaun of the Dead remains
a sterling example of the genre, and Slaughterhouse

00:04:01.250 --> 00:04:05.040
Rulez promises to deliver shocks and laughs
in equal measure.

00:04:05.040 --> 00:04:09.540
The the first effort from the pair's new Stolen
Picture banner takes place in a British boarding

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:14.590
school that "...becomes a bloody battleground
when a mysterious sinkhole appears at a nearby

00:04:14.590 --> 00:04:17.640
fracking site, unleashing unspeakable horror."

00:04:17.640 --> 00:04:22.340
With Pegg and Frost serving as producers,
the film is certainly in good hands.

00:04:22.340 --> 00:04:27.880
Writer/director Crispian Mills also directed
Pegg in 2012's horror comedy A Fantastic Fear

00:04:27.880 --> 00:04:29.010
of Everything.

00:04:29.010 --> 00:04:33.310
The film is backed by Sony Pictures, which
should ensure a fairly wide release when it

00:04:33.310 --> 00:04:35.890
hits theaters on September 7th.

00:04:35.890 --> 00:04:37.140
The Predator

00:04:37.140 --> 00:04:42.200
Attempts to reinvigorate the Predator franchise
have not historically fared well.

00:04:42.200 --> 00:04:47.550
The Alien vs. Predator mashup series failed
to do justice to either franchise, and the

00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:50.160
2010 sequel Predators garnered mixed reviews.

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:55.570
But the forthcoming sequel The Predator appears
to be in very good hands, Shane Black will

00:04:55.570 --> 00:04:58.940
direct from a script he co-wrote with Fred
Dekker.

00:04:58.940 --> 00:05:03.460
The two previously collaborated on 1987's
The Monster Squad.

00:05:03.460 --> 00:05:08.680
Featured in the cast are Keegan-Michael Key,
Olivia Munn, and Jacob Tremblay, who's apparently

00:05:08.680 --> 00:05:10.120
really getting into the role.

00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:11.400
"Jacob!"

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:12.540
"Get to the chopper.

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:14.400
We have to get out here!

00:05:14.400 --> 00:05:14.920
Go!

00:05:14.920 --> 00:05:15.580
Now!"

00:05:17.560 --> 00:05:21.870
And if all of this isn't enough to get fans
excited, then maybe the words of 20th Century

00:05:21.870 --> 00:05:25.100
Fox CEO Stacey Snider will do the trick.

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:26.100
She said:

00:05:26.100 --> 00:05:30.270
"We've got a Predator film coming out that
is unexpected and utterly fresh.

00:05:30.270 --> 00:05:33.430
[...] From the first page, it didn't read
like a Predator film."

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:37.090
The Predator sneaks into theaters on September
14th.

00:05:37.090 --> 00:05:39.310
The House with a Clock in Its Walls

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:44.060
In this upcoming film, a 10-year-old boy moves
in with an eccentric uncle, only to find his

00:05:44.060 --> 00:05:47.889
house full of secret passageways and strange
goings-on.

00:05:47.889 --> 00:05:52.280
It turns out that his uncle is a warlock,
a witch lives next door, and the house is

00:05:52.280 --> 00:05:55.180
a conduit for weird black magic rituals.

00:05:55.180 --> 00:05:57.260
"You've told Lewis everything?"

00:05:57.260 --> 00:05:59.400
"Well not everything."

00:05:59.690 --> 00:06:04.640
The House with a Clock in its Walls is an
adaptation of the 1973 gothic horror novel

00:06:04.650 --> 00:06:08.980
of the same name, and there's already some
serious talent on board.

00:06:08.980 --> 00:06:14.940
Notorious horror filmmaker Eli Roth will direct
a cast that includes Jack Black and Cate.

00:06:14.940 --> 00:06:19.600
With its strong fantasy horror vibe, this
movie is bound to be a unique addition to

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:21.430
the 2018 Halloween season.

00:06:21.430 --> 00:06:24.330
Find out when it premieres on September 21st.

00:06:24.330 --> 00:06:25.330
Hellfest

00:06:25.330 --> 00:06:31.639
This upcoming horror movie is set at a Halloween-themed
amusement park where a psycho slasher decides

00:06:31.639 --> 00:06:34.080
to have a little holiday fun of his own.

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:40.139
Gregory Plotkin, editor of Happy Death Day
and Get Out, has taken over as director, and

00:06:40.139 --> 00:06:45.280
Amy Forsyth, Reign Edwards, and Bex Taylor-Klaus
have joined the cast.

00:06:45.280 --> 00:06:50.070
Expectations are high for this one, with former
James Cameron partner and Walking Dead producer

00:06:50.070 --> 00:06:52.639
Gale Anne Hurd also involved.

00:06:52.639 --> 00:06:58.610
CBS Films president Terry Press has been championing
the film for years, believing it has the potential

00:06:58.610 --> 00:07:02.270
to start a new Purge-like horror franchise.

00:07:02.270 --> 00:07:07.940
You can judge for yourself when Hellfest debuts
on September 28th, 2018.

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:09.389
Something in the Dark

00:07:09.389 --> 00:07:14.210
This tech-based thriller has a unique premise:
a blind woman has her sight restored by a

00:07:14.210 --> 00:07:16.139
pair of high-tech eyeglasses.

00:07:16.139 --> 00:07:20.870
Unfortunately, her vision may turn out to
be a little better than she bargained for.

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:24.710
The glasses apparently let her see ghosts,
and she can't tell the difference between

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:26.630
the ghouls and the living.

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:31.510
Even worse, she begins to suspect that a lurking
entity she keeps glimpsing might be coming

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:32.510
for her.

00:07:32.510 --> 00:07:36.699
The film's website states that it will contain
no dialogue, with the goal of creating

00:07:36.699 --> 00:07:42.570
"...a more involving and creepy experience
which plays exactly the same to any audience,

00:07:42.570 --> 00:07:44.699
regardless of what language they speak."

00:07:44.699 --> 00:07:51.120
"In other words, there is literally not a
single word spoken throughout the entire film."

00:07:51.120 --> 00:07:57.070
The first feature for visual effects artist
turned debuting writer-director Steven Aguilera,

00:07:57.070 --> 00:08:00.120
Something in the Dark will definitely be a
unique experience.

00:08:00.120 --> 00:08:04.680
It's currently slated for release on October
15th, 2018.

00:08:04.680 --> 00:08:05.680
Halloween

00:08:05.680 --> 00:08:10.860
Remakes and reboots of classic horror franchises
haven't exactly been cinematic gold in recent

00:08:10.860 --> 00:08:11.860
years.

00:08:11.860 --> 00:08:15.820
With yet another Nightmare reboot struggling
to get off the ground and a planned second

00:08:15.820 --> 00:08:20.290
Friday the 13th re-imagining still up in the
air, fans could be forgiven for not getting

00:08:20.290 --> 00:08:24.620
too excited about the prospect of a new Halloween,
but they should be.

00:08:24.620 --> 00:08:29.860
Eastbound &amp; Down star Danny McBride and producer
David Gordon Green came together to work on

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:35.079
the concept for the new film, which they pitched
directly to original director/co-writer John

00:08:35.079 --> 00:08:36.079
Carpenter.

00:08:36.079 --> 00:08:40.990
Carpenter's reaction, posted to his Facebook
page, was enough to get any fan's heart racing:

00:08:40.990 --> 00:08:46.089
"David and Danny both came to my office recently
with Jason Blum and shared their vision for

00:08:46.089 --> 00:08:47.560
the new movie and…

00:08:47.560 --> 00:08:48.560
WOW.

00:08:48.560 --> 00:08:49.560
They get it.

00:08:49.560 --> 00:08:50.950
I think you're gonna dig it."

00:08:50.950 --> 00:08:56.029
He also told CBS that the new movie would
essentially retcon everything after Halloween

00:08:56.029 --> 00:08:57.029
II.

00:08:57.029 --> 00:08:59.360
"It's pretending the other sequels didn't
happen."

00:08:59.360 --> 00:09:01.829
McBride echoed that idea, saying:

00:09:01.829 --> 00:09:06.290
"It's gonna continue the story of Michael
Myers in a really grounded way.

00:09:06.290 --> 00:09:11.260
And for our mythology, we're focusing mainly
on the first two movies and what that sets

00:09:11.260 --> 00:09:12.260
up."

00:09:12.260 --> 00:09:17.029
Jamie Lee Curtis and Nick Castle, the original
Michael Myers, are reprising their roles from

00:09:17.029 --> 00:09:19.010
the 1978 film.

00:09:19.010 --> 00:09:24.360
Miramax will release Halloween on October
19th, 2018, just in time for the scariest

00:09:24.360 --> 00:09:26.319
night of the year.

00:09:26.319 --> 00:09:27.319
Overlord

00:09:27.319 --> 00:09:32.819
From J.J. Abrams' Bad Robot production company,
Overlord is a World War II-set horror flick

00:09:32.819 --> 00:09:37.749
about a group of American soldiers who make
a horrifying discovery in a Nazi-occupied

00:09:37.749 --> 00:09:38.889
village.

00:09:38.889 --> 00:09:43.209
Since this is a Bad Robot production, there's
been a lot of speculation that Overlord may

00:09:43.209 --> 00:09:49.390
be yet another stealth entry in the Cloverfield
universe, a theory which was apparently confirmed.

00:09:49.390 --> 00:09:51.450
How will it tie into the franchise?

00:09:51.450 --> 00:09:56.610
We can all find out when Overlord debuts in
theaters on October 26th.

00:09:56.610 --> 00:09:57.779
Thanks for watching!

00:09:57.779 --> 00:10:00.470
Click the Looper icon to subscribe to our
YouTube channel.

00:10:00.470 --> 00:10:02.609
Plus check out all this cool stuff we know
you'll love, too!

